{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bfd66fe-db0e-11ef-b16e-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bfd66ee-db0e-11ef-987c-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"潁陰","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諸郞，諸曹郞也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"诸郞，诸曹郞也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc2-db0e-11ef-abc4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc4-db0e-11ef-997f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"婴","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc5-db0e-11ef-9c19-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言素爲嬰之賓客者，漸以衰退，不復往也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言素为婴之宾客者，渐以衰退，不复往也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc3-db0e-11ef-847b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"燕王","people_name_jianti_auto":"燕王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc7-db0e-11ef-bf79-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"定國","people_name_jianti_auto":"定国","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc8-db0e-11ef-b2bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"澤","people_name_jianti_auto":"泽","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc9-db0e-11ef-bf75-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"夫","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebca-db0e-11ef-a44e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebcb-db0e-11ef-92bd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"潁陰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍阴县","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebcc-db0e-11ef-ae58-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川郡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebcd-db0e-11ef-bbb2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"燕王定國，王澤之孫也；夫自太僕出相之。班志，潁陰縣屬潁川郡。相，息亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"燕王定国，王泽之孙也；夫自太仆出相之。班志，颍阴县属颍川郡。相，息亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc6-db0e-11ef-b328-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张晏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd0-db0e-11ef-b047-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd1-db0e-11ef-b38e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"張晏曰：相薦達爲聲勢也。師古曰：相牽引以致於尊重也。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"张晏曰：相荐达为声势也。师古曰：相牵引以致于尊重也。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebcf-db0e-11ef-8a32-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"夫","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd4-db0e-11ef-a519-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"灌氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"灌氏","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd5-db0e-11ef-b031-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"灌氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"灌氏","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd6-db0e-11ef-ac88-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd7-db0e-11ef-9165-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁水","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍水","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd8-db0e-11ef-914b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁水","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍水","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd9-db0e-11ef-a582-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"夫宗族、賓客爲權利，橫於潁川；小兒歌之曰：「潁水清，灌氏寧；潁水濁，灌氏族。」橫，戶孟翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"夫宗族、宾客为权利，横于颍川；小儿歌之曰：「颍水清，灌氏宁；颍水浊，灌氏族。」横，户孟翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebd3-db0e-11ef-9f75-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebdb-db0e-11ef-9a9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebdc-db0e-11ef-a18c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebdd-db0e-11ef-a127-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"刑人於市，與衆棄之，故殺之於市者謂之棄市。景帝中元年，改磔曰棄市。應劭曰：先諸死刑皆磔於市，今改曰棄市，自非妖逆，不復磔也。師古曰：磔，謂張其尸也。棄市，殺之於市也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"刑人于市，与众弃之，故杀之于市者谓之弃市。景帝中元年，改磔曰弃市。应劭曰：先诸死刑皆磔于市，今改曰弃市，自非妖逆，不复磔也。师古曰：磔，谓张其尸也。弃市，杀之于市也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":147,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebda-db0e-11ef-bd9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長樂宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"长乐宫","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebdf-db0e-11ef-93b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"未央宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"未央宫","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe0-db0e-11ef-b456-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長樂宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"长乐宫","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe1-db0e-11ef-928e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"東朝，謂太后居長樂宮，在未央宮之東也；令於長樂宮見太后，廷辨其是非也。朝，直遙翻，下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"东朝，谓太后居长乐宫，在未央宫之东也；令于长乐宫见太后，廷辨其是非也。朝，直遥翻，下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":167,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebde-db0e-11ef-a8d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"若屬，猶言汝輩也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"若属，犹言汝辈也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":232,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe3-db0e-11ef-9dd9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"晉灼","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋灼","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe6-db0e-11ef-bb2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉灼曰：藉，蹈也。藉，慈夜翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋灼曰：藉，蹈也。藉，慈夜翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":265,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe5-db0e-11ef-b9c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe8-db0e-11ef-a35d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：以比魚肉而食啖也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：以比鱼肉而食啖也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":278,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebe7-db0e-11ef-b7f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8f84ebc1-db0e-11ef-ac92-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"jié","source_anchor_text":"因互相詆訐上問朝臣","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":176,"text":"訐","tongjian_id":"e0baec7c-d7bb-5bf3-8f63-44ec4a2dbea6"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"潁陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍阴","place_note":"河南許昌","resolved_place_entity_id":3326,"start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8f8721f7-db0e-11ef-891d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉母后","excerpts":[{"context_after":"韩嫣得幸于上，江都王为太后泣，请得入宿卫比嫣，后繇此衔嫣...","context_before":"...东宫，后大怒，求得二人奸利事以责上，上下绾、臧吏，杀之。","source_end_index":294,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9be3ffd2-3469-42c6-8678-33be0f520187","source_start_index":241,"source_text":"窦婴、田蚡廷辩，王太后大怒不食，曰：“我在也，而人皆藉吾弟，且帝宁能为石人邪！”帝不直蚡，特为太后故杀婴。"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/汉母后","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/灌夫任安","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。卫青为大将军，霍去病财为校尉，已而皆为大司马。青日衰，...","context_before":"...，同日免。蚡后为丞相，而婴不用，无势，诸公稍自引而怠骜，","source_end_index":44,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"acfd3931-a172-4f66-bef1-80041fa66cb4","source_start_index":39,"source_text":"唯灌夫独否"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/灌夫任安","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉武帝田蚡公孙弘","excerpts":[{"context_after":"；于公孙弘则云性意忌，外宽内深，饰诈钓名，不为贤大夫所称...","context_before":"...奢极侈，置生民于涂炭；于田蚡则诋其负贵骄溢，以肺腑为相，","source_end_index":60,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c0382e57-bfaa-49df-8f96-9de1acd71461","source_start_index":54,"source_text":"杀窦婴、灌夫"}],"path":"五笔/卷四/汉武帝田蚡公孙弘","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2初，孝景時，魏其侯竇嬰爲大將軍，武安侯田蚡乃爲諸郞，侍酒跪起如子姪；已而蚡日益貴幸，爲丞相。魏其失勢，賓客益衰，獨故燕相潁陰灌夫不去。嬰乃厚遇夫，相爲引重，其游如父子然。夫爲人剛直，使酒，諸有勢在己之右者必陵之；數因酒忤丞相。丞相乃奏案：「灌夫家屬橫潁川，民苦之。」收繫夫及支屬，皆得棄市罪。魏其上書論救灌夫，上令與武安東朝廷辨之。魏其、武安因互相詆訐。上問朝臣：「兩人孰是？」唯汲黯是魏其，韓安國兩以爲是；鄭當時是魏其，後不敢堅。上怒當時曰：「吾幷斬若屬矣！」卽罷。起，入，上食太后，太后怒不食，曰：「今我在也，而人皆藉吾弟；令我百歲後，皆魚肉之乎！」上不得已，遂族灌夫；使有司案治魏其，得棄市罪。","content_fanyi":"当初，孝景帝在位时，魏其侯窦婴担任大将军，武安侯田蚡还只是众多郎官中的一员，在窦婴身旁侍酒时跪拜起立如同子侄；后来田蚡日益显贵受宠，做了丞相。魏其侯失去权势后，门客日益减少，只有前燕相、颍阴人灌夫不肯离去。窦婴于是厚待灌夫，两人相互推重，交游如同父子一般。灌夫为人刚强正直，好借酒使气，凡是权势在自己之上的人，他必定加以欺凌；又多次因酒醉触犯丞相。丞相于是上奏查办说：“灌夫家人在颍川横行，百姓深受其害。”便将灌夫及其宗族旁支拘捕入狱，全都定为弃市之罪。魏其侯上书论理营救灌夫，武帝命令他与武安侯到东宫当廷辩明。魏其侯与武安侯因此互相攻击揭短。武帝问朝臣：“两人谁对？”只有汲黯认为魏其侯对，韩安国认为双方都有道理；郑当时也认为魏其侯对，但后来不敢坚持。武帝对郑当时发怒说：“我把你们这些人一起斩了！”随即罢朝。武帝起身入内，侍奉太后进食，太后发怒不肯吃，说：“如今我还活着，别人就都来践踏我弟弟；假使我死后，岂不都要把他当作鱼肉了吗！”武帝不得已，于是将灌夫灭族；又命有关官员审理魏其侯，定为弃市之罪。","content_jianti_auto":"2初，孝景时，魏其侯窦婴为大将军，武安侯田蚡乃为诸郞，侍酒跪起如子姪；已而蚡日益贵幸，为丞相。魏其失势，宾客益衰，独故燕相颍阴灌夫不去。婴乃厚遇夫，相为引重，其游如父子然。夫为人刚直，使酒，诸有势在己之右者必陵之；数因酒忤丞相。丞相乃奏案：「灌夫家属横颍川，民苦之。」收系夫及支属，皆得弃市罪。魏其上书论救灌夫，上令与武安东朝廷辨之。魏其、武安因互相诋讦。上问朝臣：「两人孰是？」唯汲黯是魏其，韩安国两以为是；郑当时是魏其，后不敢坚。上怒当时曰：「吾幷斩若属矣！」即罢。起，入，上食太后，太后怒不食，曰：「今我在也，而人皆藉吾弟；令我百岁后，皆鱼肉之乎！」上不得已，遂族灌夫；使有司案治魏其，得弃市罪。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1436,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第十八 (漢紀十) / 世宗孝武皇帝上之下 / 三年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc1-db0e-11ef-ac92-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-132},"tongjian_id":"8f84ebc1-db0e-11ef-ac92-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"潁陰","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"朗陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"朗陵","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96cd6b85-db0e-11ef-8e75-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝南郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"96cd6b86-db0e-11ef-8e5e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朗陵，侯國，屬汝南郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朗陵，侯国，属汝南郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"96cd6b84-db0e-11ef-be7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96cd6b8d-db0e-11ef-aa5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荀淑","people_name_jianti_aut